{"total_count":6,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/664","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/664/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/664/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/664/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/664","id":1451401521,"node_id":"I_kwDOGiE5WM5WgqEx","number":664,"title":"Feature request: support for file upload","user":{"login":"skitsanos","id":1391820,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTE4MjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1391820?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos","html_url":"https://github.com/skitsanos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/skitsanos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":4338084797,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGiE5WM8AAAABApHrvQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"C5DEF5","default":true,"description":"New feature or request.","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":36,"created_at":"2022-11-16T11:21:06Z","updated_at":"2025-02-21T13:25:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"I have a played a bit here with `bun` and `hono` to see how it works and realized that the request body comes there in raw format if I want to upload files.\r\n\r\nsurprisingly, getting body as a buffer worked out of the box:\r\n\r\n```ts\r\n const reader = ctx.req.body.getReader()\r\n const result = await reader.read()\r\n const buffer = Buffer.from(result.value ?? [])\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo I have my `buffer`, but the question is -- do we have anything is there any functionality to have a list of files within that buffer?\r\n\r\nIn other words, - maybe there is an example of implementing file uploading with `hono`, or at least some timeline on when it will be available.\r\n\r\nThank you.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/664/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/664/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/482","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/482/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/482/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/482/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/482","id":1350156343,"node_id":"I_kwDOGiE5WM5QecA3","number":482,"title":"[Discussion] What middleware do you want?","user":{"login":"yusukebe","id":10682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe","html_url":"https://github.com/yusukebe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":45,"created_at":"2022-08-25T00:23:59Z","updated_at":"2024-12-30T22:43:44Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"From v2.0.0, we can create 3rd party middleware. So far, the following 3rd-party middleware has been created.\r\n\r\n* GraphQL Middleware\r\n* Firebase Auth Middleware\r\n* Validator Middleware\r\n* Sentry Middleware\r\n\r\nGraphQL Middleware was originally provided as Built-in Middleware, which I also use. Firebase Auth make more authentication options for Cloudflare Workers. Validator Middleware is my creation, and I like it. Sentry Middleware will be very helpful in catching errors at the edge.\r\n\r\nNext, What middleware do you want?\r\n\r\nIf there is any Middleware you want, please comment here, even if you don't make it yourself. Someone may make it. You may also get other ideas by seeing the ideas here.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/482/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/482/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4807","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4807/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4807/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4807/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/4807","id":4091927181,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGiE5WM7LYouL","number":4807,"title":"fix(request): remove `parseBody` from bodyCache to prevent TypeError","user":{"login":"yusukebe","id":10682,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10682?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe","html_url":"https://github.com/yusukebe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yusukebe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-03-18T00:26:17Z","updated_at":"2026-03-21T11:03:19Z","closed_at":"2026-03-21T11:02:50Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/4807","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/4807","diff_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/4807.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/4807.patch","merged_at":"2026-03-21T11:02:50Z"},"body":"Fixes #4806\r\n\r\nI realized `bodyCache.parsedBody` in Hono Request is unnecessary, and this change will fix #4806.\r\n\r\n`parseBody` uses `formData` inside, so it might already be cached:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/honojs/hono/blob/fe689eceb7834db653a64ecae5f8d203d9c23b9a/src/utils/body.ts#L125\r\n\r\n\r\n### The author should do the following, if applicable\r\n\r\n- [x] Add tests\r\n- [x] Run tests\r\n- [x] `bun run format:fix && bun run lint:fix` to format the code\r\n- [ ] Add [TSDoc](https://tsdoc.org/)/[JSDoc](https://jsdoc.app/about-getting-started) to document the code\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4807/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/4807/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/2695","id":2303197266,"node_id":"I_kwDOGiE5WM6JSABS","number":2695,"title":"Empty c.req.raw body for application/x-www-form-urlencoded","user":{"login":"LuisMalhadas","id":93918064,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZkTcA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93918064?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas","html_url":"https://github.com/LuisMalhadas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuisMalhadas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5831663291,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGiE5WM8AAAABW5geuw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"D69931","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":9,"created_at":"2024-05-17T16:49:58Z","updated_at":"2024-08-10T10:17:04Z","closed_at":"2024-08-10T10:17:04Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What version of Hono are you using?\n\n4.3.6\n\n### What runtime/platform is your app running on?\n\nbun 1.1.8\n\n### What steps can reproduce the bug?\n\n```\r\nimport { HTTPException } from 'hono/http-exception'\r\nimport { OpenAPIHono } from '@hono/zod-openapi'\r\n\r\nconst app = new OpenAPIHono()\r\n\r\napp.use(async (c, next) => {\r\n  console.log('Request received:: \\n',c.req.raw)\r\n  const bod = await c.req.parseBody()\r\n  console.log('After parse:: ',bod)\r\n  await next()\r\n})\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n  port: 4000,\r\n  fetch: app.fetch,\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\n\n### What is the expected behavior?\n\n```\r\n{\r\n  accept: \"*/*\",\r\n  \"accept-encoding\": \"deflate, gzip, br\",\r\n  authorization: \"-------\",\r\n  \"content-length\": \"125073\",\r\n  \"content-type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\r\n  host: \"api-service:4000\",\r\n  \"user-agent\": \"MoodleBot/4.3 (+http://localhost:8080)\",\r\n  client_id: \"nkalnw0ov\",\r\n}\r\n^\\ftypM4A M4A isommp42^Amdat^A� ...\r\n```\n\n### What do you see instead?\n\n```\r\nRequest (0 KB) {\r\nmethod: \"POST\",\r\nurl: \"http://api-service:4000/endpoint\",\r\nheaders: Headers {\r\n    \"host\": \"api-service:4000\",\r\n     \"accept\": \"*/*\",\r\n     \"accept-encoding\": \"deflate, gzip, br\",\r\n     \"authorization\": \"------\",\r\n     \"user-agent\": \"MoodleBot/4.3 (+http://localhost:8080)\",\r\n     \"content-length\": \"125073\",\r\n     \"content-type\": \"application/x-www-form-urlencoded\",\r\n   }\r\n}\r\n{}\r\n```\n\n### Additional information\n\nI can get the body using plain bun.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2077","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2077/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2077/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2077/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/2077","id":2097704620,"node_id":"PR_kwDOGiE5WM5k7CHS","number":2077,"title":"feat: new built-in middleware bodyLimit","user":{"login":"EdamAme-x","id":121654029,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0BLDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121654029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x","html_url":"https://github.com/EdamAme-x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":36,"created_at":"2024-01-24T08:25:05Z","updated_at":"2024-02-25T10:03:41Z","closed_at":"2024-02-09T05:53:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/pulls/2077","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/2077","diff_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/2077.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/pull/2077.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"### Author should do the followings, if applicable\r\nI saw this DISCUSSION and implemented it.\r\nhttps://github.com/orgs/honojs/discussions/2048\r\nIt takes a little time to prepare an explanation.\r\n\r\n- [x] Add tests\r\n- [x] Run tests\r\n- [x] `yarn denoify` to generate files for Deno\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2077/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/458","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/458/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/458/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/458/events","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/458","id":1331978432,"node_id":"I_kwDOGiE5WM5PZGDA","number":458,"title":"Cannot download/stream file greater than 128mb using hono","user":{"login":"Divkix","id":23524935,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzNTI0OTM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23524935?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix","html_url":"https://github.com/Divkix","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Divkix/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2022-08-08T14:42:55Z","updated_at":"2022-08-09T01:40:18Z","closed_at":"2022-08-09T01:35:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"My team and I have been using hono in many services and loving it a lot.\r\nHowever recently we made a worker to download our files from an r2 bucket, but whenever we tried, it gave errors.\r\n\r\nWhenever I try to download a large file:\r\n```\r\nGET https://mybucket.mydomain.com/get/test200m - Ok @ 08/08/2022, 20:06:00\r\n  (log)   <-- GET /get/test200m\r\n  (error) TypeError: Memory limit would be exceeded before EOF.\r\n    at parseBody (index.js:334:35)\r\n    at index.js:970:49\r\n    at async index.js:884:9\r\n    at async index.js:793:9\r\n    at async index.js:902:9\r\n    at async Hono2.dispatch (index.js:733:21)\r\n  (log)   --> GET /get/test200m 500 155ms\r\n``` \r\n\r\nThe URL `/get/test200m` gives me `Internal Server Error`.\r\n\r\nI tried working around it and found that normal module workers were able to easily perform this operation.\r\n\r\nHono code to download file, which *does not work*:\r\nhttps://github.com/divideprojects/cdn/blob/6f1c5178ea33b2f19e7cdd72bbdc9873e538aafc/src/_fileOperations.ts#L6...L32\r\nhono routes:\r\nhttps://github.com/divideprojects/cdn/blob/6f1c5178ea33b2f19e7cdd72bbdc9873e538aafc/src/index.ts#L21\r\n\r\n\r\nWithout hono, which *works*:\r\nhttps://github.com/divideprojects/cdn/blob/21550bb848fc016c3a83338236fe4700681e8df9/src/index.ts#L36..L75\r\n\r\nI was able to download the file without hono but with hono I'm running into issues.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/458/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/458/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0}],"search_type":"lexical"}